=== tunnels ===
Tunnels are funky. They allow for knot-injection basically. They are like sub-routines or -stories which similar to functions by default return to where they were called from.
-> tunnel_dream ->
They will just take you back after.

You can also chain tunnels together.
-> tunnel_in -> tunnel_mid -> tunnel_out ->

Just make sure to end your tunnels with \->\-> !
+tunnels as options
    ->tunnels_as_options
+[done]
    ->INDEX

=== tunnel_dream ===
These sub-sections can be as complicated or simple as you want them to be.
->->

=== tunnel_in ===
go in.
->->

=== tunnel_mid ===
go through.
->->

=== tunnel_out ===
go out.
->->

